The crash is in BLAS - I would suggest installing R 2.14.0 from CRAN or alternatively switching to R BLAS instead of vecLib, because vecLib attempts to start threads (and there are known ABI issues when using vecLib instead of R BLAS) [i.e., this is not really related to Rserve but rather R].

Cheers,
Simon


