Bill,

normally, you just have to run jgr.exe (just double-click on the icon) - that is the normal way to start JGR and it should work from a server equally well as long as R is properly registered on the machine. Using JGR() from R is a fall-back hack for convenience, but it's not intended for normal use.

Cheers,
Simon


