Message-ID: <65E39721-017D-4320-9E13-4666C6341D0F@r-project.org>

Yang,

your'e using old R. Your Java has broken java.library.path (see the paths under "Java library path", they are bogus) and R 2.14.0 provides a work-around for it. If you don't want to upgrade R you can set JAVA_LD_LIBRARY_PATH and JAVA_LIBS manually to reflect your actual setup, but it's easier to use R 2.14.0 or later.

Cheers,
Simon


